html
  head
    title Profil
  body
    h1 Profil
    p Korisnik: #{user.username}
    p Trenutni email: #{user.email}

    form(action="/profile/email" method="post")
      input(type="hidden" name="_csrf" value=csrfToken)
      input(type="email" name="email" required)
      button(type="submit") Promijeni email

    hr
    form(action="/toggle/csrf" method="post")
      label
        input(type="checkbox" name="csrf_protected" checked=csrfProtected onchange="this.form.submit()")
        |  CSRF zaštita uključena
    p Napadačeva stranica: 
      a(href="/attacker" target="_blank") /attacker